Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): Then we have an adapter, which is really, as I said, where the two worlds meet, because it bridges the Ethereum and Fabric worlds. It proxies the two protocols, and it orchestrates the flows such that this Ethereum smart contract invocation that comes in is translated into

