00:16:56.120 --> 00:17:03.720
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): Our beloved fabric endors, submit for ordering, validate, and commit.

117
00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:11.560
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): Then this adapter, in order to do that, it will have to instantiate the EVM.

