00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:13.070
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): The API layer forwards this to the adapter. The adapter is going to pass the request, perform the necessary verification, for instance, verifying the signature of the requester, working out the address of the originator of the request, and other things.

