00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:36.299
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): The EVM is gonna do what it does, and then at some point it might have to access the state DB.

133
00:19:36.430 --> 00:19:43.519
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): In order to satisfy reads or handle writes, and it will do so.

134
00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.310
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): At some point, the request is,

135
00:19:47.480 --> 00:20:00.269
