00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:14.690
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): And during… during that execution.

138
00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:29.670
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): And then finally, in step 7, the adapter with this read-write set, it does all the rest of the fabric stuff, so it endorses it, and so forth, sends it for ordering, checks for finality, and all of that.

