00:45:00.270 --> 00:45:06.469
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): And so, I mean, as you know, the good news is that all of this is possible in Fabric.

340
00:45:06.540 --> 00:45:10.479
Alessandro Sorniotti (IBM): The only… Caveat will be…

